.* QUICFG: WRKCFGSTS (lines, controllers and devices with what hangs
.* off each, indented by the driver) and DSPDEVD.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=DESCCL BASETYPE='CHAR 16'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=HINTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 19'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=JOBCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=POSTO CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=POSHINT CLASS=HINTCL VALUE='Starting characters'.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=CFNAME CLASS=DESCCL.
:VAR NAME=CFOBJ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CFSTS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=CFJOB CLASS=JOBCL.
:VAR NAME=CFTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DVNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DVCLS CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DVTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DVMODEL CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DVONLINE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DVSTATUS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=DVCTL CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DVKBD CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DVMSGQ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DVMSGQL CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DVOUTQ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DVOUTQL CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DVTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=CFGS VARS='OPT CFNAME CFOBJ CFSTS CFJOB CFTYPE'.
:VAR NAME=KEYSET CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='1'.
:COND NAME=KEYS1 EXPR='&KEYSET. EQ "1"'.
:COND NAME=KEYS2 EXPR='&KEYSET. EQ "2"'.
.* Two sets of keys the driver switches with F24, as the condition
.* KEYSET says; the area keeps its two rows.
:KEYL NAME=WRKKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT COND=KEYS1.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4' COND=KEYS1.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL COND=KEYS1.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F23 ACTION='RETURN 23' COND=KEYS1.F23=More options
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5' COND=KEYS2.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE COND=KEYS2.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=KEYS2.F11=Display types
:KEYI KEY=F14 ACTION='RETURN 14' COND=KEYS2.F14=Work with lines
:KEYI KEY=F24 ACTION='RETURN 24'.F24=More keys
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKCFGSTS HELP=HLPCFG KEYL=WRKKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=DATETIME.Work with Configuration Status
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATACOL WIDTH=22.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=POSTO USAGE=INPUT.Position to
:DATAIX VAR=POSHINT USAGE=OUTPUT.
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=CFGS VIEWS=2 SCROLL=YES.(No configuration descriptions)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD VRYCFG CFGOBJ(&CFOBJ.) CFGTYPE(&CFTYPE.) STATUS(*ON)'.1=Vary on
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD VRYCFG CFGOBJ(&CFOBJ.) CFGTYPE(&CFTYPE.) STATUS(*OFF)'.2=Vary off
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105'.5=Work with job
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='RETURN 108'.8=Work with description
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='RETURN 109'.9=Display mode status
:LISTACT OPTION=13 ENTER='RETURN 113'.13=Work with APPN status...
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=CFNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Description
:LISTCOL VAR=CFSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=CFJOB USAGE=OUTPUT.-------------Job--------------
:LISTCOL VAR=CFTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT CFNAME CFSTS CFJOB'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT CFNAME CFSTS CFTYPE'.
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters or command
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPDEVD HELP=HLPDEVD KEYL=DSPKEYS TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Device Description
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATAI VAR=DVNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Device description
:DATAI VAR=DVCLS USAGE=OUTPUT.Device class
:DATAI VAR=DVTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Device type
:DATAI VAR=DVMODEL USAGE=OUTPUT.Device model
:DATAI VAR=DVONLINE USAGE=OUTPUT.Online at IPL
:DATAI VAR=DVSTATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:DATAI VAR=DVCTL USAGE=OUTPUT.Attached controller
:DATAI VAR=DVKBD USAGE=OUTPUT.Keyboard language type
:DATAI VAR=DVMSGQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Message queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=DVMSGQL USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=DVOUTQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Output queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=DVOUTQL USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=DVTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCFG.Work with Configuration Status - Help
:P.The lines, controllers or devices asked for, each with what is
attached to it indented beneath, and their status. Type 1 to vary one
on, 2 to vary it off, 8 to work with its description, and press Enter.
F11 shows the type of each object instead of its job; F24 shows the
other keys.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F5 reads the status again, F11 switches between jobs and types,
F14 lists the line descriptions, F9 brings back the last command, F3
and F12 leave.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPDEVD.Display Device Description - Help
:P.This display shows a device description: what kind of device it is,
whether it is varied on at IPL and now, and where its messages and
printed output go. CHGDEVD changes it.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
